{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1545216-divine-rule-tracker","id":1545216,"title":"Divine Rule Tracker","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-11-02T11:14:19-07:00","id":1545216,"title":"Divine Rule Tracker","content":"This is the work of a few days, and one that I'll be testing with my own campaign group later, but I wanted to create a tracker for Divine Rule play.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YFnD-E1JYAQySUpqOC6phvfQOqYwJFuDAtIIeBFkdQ4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">So, I made one!</a><br /> <br /> This tracker is very much a prototype, which I'll be experimenting more with in the future once I get a better handle of Google Sheets, but currently it has the following features:<ul><li>Full Trackers for Divine Fiat, Personal, Miraculous and Titled Investment</li> <li>Fill-in sheets for Callings, Purviews and Legendary Titles</li> <li>Divine Wound Tracker</li> <li>Ability for Callings to be Sealed Off for Titans</li> </ul>In the future, what I'm hoping to do:<ul><li>Hide extra action slots depending on Calling Dots, Purview Innate Status, etc.</li> <li>Add options for Knacks which affect Divine Rule.</li> <li>Create an automatic system for releasing commitments once a given time period has elapsed, such as healing Divine Wounds after an Episode, releasing actions after a full arc to make them permanent, etc.</li> <li>Dragon and (once we have the rules for it) Mythos tabs for those types of characters.</li> </ul>If you have any suggestions to add to the list above, or any suggestions for how I can accomplish the above in Google Sheets, let me know! As I mentioned earlier, this tracker is going to be used for my God-level campaign in order to test its effectiveness, so I might make some changes in the future based on my player's feedback.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Added a tracker for when the God/Titan is vulnerable to Title Theft, Mantle Usurpation or outright Deicide. It's not a precise measurement, it just tracks whether the god has at least 3, 5 or 16 Divine Wounds, irrespective of the wound's placement and the deity's number of traits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26317,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","user":"Critian Caceorte","date":". 11-02-2024, 05:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-03T10:07:14-08:00","id":1545259,"title":"","content":"Very Cool! I hope the Demigod game I\u2019m playing in runs longs enough for me to use it at God tier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-03T22:42:02-08:00","id":1545278,"title":"","content":"Just realized there was an issue with the Effect tracker where it would scale off of the TOTAL Legend used and not the Legend used to generate Effect. Essentially, if you used 3 Legend, 2 to create Effect and 1 to pay off a 1-point Complication, it would register that as 3 Effect total instead of 2.<br /> <br /> This has now been fixed. I am also in the process of creating a prototype Dragon Tracker based on what little of the rules we currently know. It's subject to change once the Dragon Companion comes out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-25T12:38:52-07:00","id":1554668,"title":"","content":"With the God Companion Update, I've added to the Dragon Tracker, and have included a separate Mythos Tracker as well. They're both still WIPs, but they SHOULD work for the most part. Let me know if there's anything that needs fixing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}